      "parts": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"You are helping a nuclear physicist run the EXCLURAD radiative-corrections code. Request: Pion channel (ep -> e'n pi+): one point at W = 1.4 GeV, Q2 = 0.8 GeV2, cos theta* = 0.3, phi* = 120 degrees.\n\nWhen you are done, write an `outcome.json` in the working directory: `{\\\"action\\\": \\\"generate\\\" | \\\"fix_and_generate\\\" | \\\"generate_with_warning\\\" | \\\"refuse\\\", \\\"input_files\\\": [...], \\\"flags\\\": [...], \\\"explanation\\\": \\\"...\\\"}`. Write any EXCLURAD input files you produce next to it. If the request is physically impossible, refuse and say why. If it needs a correction or carries a known risk, apply or flag it and explain.\"",
          "id": "prt_088ced9fe00133lIvMRmkGXCPr",
          "sessionID": "ses_f7731261bffeCc3E6Pu0WiL2tr",
          "messageID": "msg_088ced9fb001PJLF0wwFwfbiCb"
        }
      ]
    },
